Which symbol names the vector drawn below?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\coordinate (S) at (0,2.0);
\coordinate (T) at (3.8,0);
\fill (S) circle (2.5pt);
\fill (T) circle (2.5pt);
\draw[->,thick] (T) -- (S);
\node[above] at (S) {$S$};
\node[below] at (T) {$T$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
